# 1.4.1: the screen, dark or light: KNOB 3 on the Journey page (GLO, a third time). Saved, as Lights; the colours
# follow at the next frame; the held effects' lettering reads on both
wait 300
expect light 0
expect pfcontrast 0
tap GLO
wait 300
tap GLO
wait 300
tap GLO
wait 600
shot dark.png
turn K3 2
wait 200
expect light 1
expect dirty 1
expect pfcontrast 0
wait 2500
shot light.png
# saved, and still light after a restart
press SAVE
wait 600
release SAVE
wait 40
expect dirty 0
reboot
wait 600
expect light 1
shot light_restart.png
tap HOME
wait 600
tap GLO
wait 300
tap GLO
wait 300
tap GLO
wait 600
turn K3 -1
wait 200
expect light 0
# (packs) a turn more: Auto, as the piece is. The eight are dark
turn K3 -1
wait 200
expect light 2
expect lit 0
turn K3 1
wait 200
expect light 0
wait 600
shot dark_again.png
